    {
      "index": 6,
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "True if the file’s numeric user ID (group ID) is ⟦0⟧. These tests support ranges (‘⟦1⟧’ and ‘⟦2⟧’), unlike ‘⟦3⟧’ and ‘⟦4⟧’.",
