        "⟦0⟧": "<var class=\"var\">n</var>",
        "⟦1⟧": "<samp class=\"samp\">+<var class=\"var\">n</var></samp>",
        "⟦2⟧": "<samp class=\"samp\">-<var class=\"var\">n</var></samp>",
        "⟦3⟧": "<samp class=\"samp\">-user</samp>",
        "⟦4⟧": "<samp class=\"samp\">-group</samp>"
      },
      "sourceHTML": "<p>True if the file’s numeric user ID (group ID) is <var class=\"var\">n</var>.  These tests\nsupport ranges (‘<samp class=\"samp\">+<var class=\"var\">n</var></samp>’ and ‘<samp class=\"samp\">-<var class=\"var\">n</var></samp>’), unlike\n‘<samp class=\"samp\">-user</samp>’ and ‘<samp class=\"samp\">-group</samp>’.\n</p>"
    },
